question 'A user tries to load a news feed and gets a blank screen. The developer checks the logs and sees the news provider\'s servers are completely unresponsive. Which type of failure best describes this situation?'

right 'Server failure'
wrong 'Network failure'
wrong 'Invalid data error'
wrong 'Client-side parsing error'

